00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.990
<b>That dangerous, huh?</b>

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.590
<b>I think that's enough.</b>

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.390
<b>Mirashiem!</b>

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.310
<b>She merely bought time for her friends?</b>

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.030
<b>Tigre, stay with me. It won't be much longer.</b>

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.280
<b>We're almost there.</b>

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.150
<b>Captain Roland!</b>

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.450
<b>The enemy launched an ambush to our rear!</b>

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.160
<b>How many of them?</b>

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.450
<b>About three hundred!</b>

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.580
<b>I am Mashas Rodant!</b>

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.580
<b>I've come to assist Sir Tigrevurmud Vorn!</b>

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.420
<b>Abandon pursuit!</b>

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.500
<b>Get into formation on the double!</b>

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.050
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.210
<b>You're telling me I can't even see His Majesty?</b>

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:31.150
<b>Sir Roland, he is very ill.</b>

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.560
<b>Please understand.</b>

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.900
<b>This is hard on us too.</b>

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.980
<b>But you could give His Majesty some peace of mind</b>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:43.780
<b>by eradicating the traitorous Count Vorn and that Zhctedian army infesting Brune,</b>

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:49.660
<b>In the meantime, we'll take care of Sachstein and Asvarre.</b>

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:54.290
<b>They won't threaten our borders much longer. So put down this insurgency immediately.</b>

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.380
<b>I don't trust them.</b>

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.800
<b>I must finish Count Vorn as soon as possible, 
and talk with His Majesty.</b>

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.940
<b>Thank you, Sir Mashas.</b>

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:17.440
<b>Your attack made them give up chasing us.</b>

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.110
<b>Never mind me. How is Tigre doing?</b>

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.240
<b>The wound's deep.</b>

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.450
<b>His fever won't break either.</b>

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.450
<b>Lord Tigre...</b>

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.170
<b>Pardon my abruptness, Mashas,</b>

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.960
<b>but please tell us what happened in the capital.</b>

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.090
<b>I was unable to get an audience with the king.</b>

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.840
<b>Having no other choice left, I barged into the palace.</b>

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:50.930
<b>Duke Thenardier and Duke Ganelon pretty much run the place now.</b>

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.680
<b>It was a terrible sight.</b>

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:59.610
<b>I've come here not as the 
prime minister, but as your friend.</b>

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.190
<b>Badouin,</b>

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:05.070
<b>does this mean you'll take me to His Majesty's private chamber?</b>

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.490
<b>Please keep what you are about to hear to yourself.</b>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.500
<b>What on earth <i>is</i> that sound?</b>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.260
<b>His Majesty is playing with building blocks.</b>

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.550
<b>Building blocks?</b>

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.470
<b>How pitiful.</b>

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.390
<b>He must've gone mad with grief after losing the prince.</b>

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:38.400
<b>Only a handful of people, including Badouin, know about His Majesty's condition.</b>

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:42.570
<b>Ganelon and Thenardier have probably noticed already.</b>

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:48.570
<b>And no matter the circumstances, 
Tigre would need a very good reason, a just cause,</b>

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.320
<b>for contracting foreign soldiers.</b>

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.200
<b>That's what Badouin said.</b>

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:56.750
<b>We wanted to gain His Majesty's permission after 
showing Tigre has Brune's best interest in heart.</b>

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:01.090
<b>Though there doesn't seem to be a way he could make his case in this situation.</b>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:06.300
<b>And that's why Roland is attacking us: Vorn can't demonstrate his innocence.</b>

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.840
<b>Thenardier and Ganelon put Roland up to it.</b>

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.140
<b>By the way, Sir Mashas,</b>

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.260
<b>how did you meet Sofy?</b>

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:21.060
<b>Oh, Lady Sofya, you still haven't told them?</b>

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:25.030
<b>Well, the battle started mere moments after I arrived.</b>

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.860
<b>And I figured I should be careful about what I tell them.</b>

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:33.740
<b>After meeting with Badouin, I made my way back.</b>

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.910
<b>Sure enough, I was ambushed by assassins.</b>

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.000
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:51.660
<b>Did Thenardier send them? Or did Ganelon?</b>

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.640
<b>Good question.</b>

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.180
<b>Anyway, the one who saved me from them</b>

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.980
<b>was Lady Sofya here.</b>

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.230
<b>Yeah, he'll be fine. Don't worry.</b>

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.570
<b>Who were they?</b>

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.870
<b>Some of our men are concerned about the young lord. They came to see him.</b>

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.500
<b>Soldiers from Alsace?</b>

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.040
<b>No, that squad belongs to Viscount Augre's forces.</b>

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:26.090
<b>They must've been impressed that the young lord landed a blow on Roland.</b>

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.130
<b>I see.</b>

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.970
<b>May I have a moment?</b>

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:35.180
<b>Could you leave Vorn and me alone for a minute?</b>

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.180
<b>I have something I want to tell him.</b>

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.480
<b>Okay then.</b>

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:50.440
<b>Um, if anything happens, please call me at once.</b>

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.320
<b>I'll be right outside.</b>

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.280
<b>Got it.</b>

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.510
<b>I'm sure you're dear to him, Titta.</b>

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:24.400
<b>Tigre...</b>

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:27.820
<b>you're fast asleep,</b>

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:30.820
<b>so you probably can't hear me.</b>

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.530
<b>So feel my heartbeat with the back of your hand instead.</b>

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.040
<b>Sense it beating,</b>

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.960
<b>remember that you're still alive,</b>

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.710
<b>and realize how I feel about you.</b>

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.210
<b>I'll lead the soldiers in your stead.</b>

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:56.090
<b>I'll defend those you wished to defend.</b>

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.470
<b>You...</b>

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.930
<b>belong to me, after all.</b>

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.320
<b>The wind is picking up, huh?</b>

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:14.280
<b>I wonder if it's going to rain.</b>

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.990
<b>It sure looks like it.</b>

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:22.220
<b>Are you about to use your dragon art 
against a mere human?</b>

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.700
<b>I am.</b>

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.290
<b>Then I'll give you a hand.</b>

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.920
<b>Sofy! You're here as an envoy!</b>

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.800
<b>You shouldn't do that, should you?</b>

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.720
<b>Seeing how he managed to turn you this serious</b>

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:40.930
<b>has made me really curious about Sir Tigrevurmud.</b>

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.100
<b>Hey, now...</b>

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.810
<b>You can't have him.</b>

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.100
<b>He's mine.</b>

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.690
<b>While it's true that his county is near the border,</b>

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.070
<b>he had no diplomatic ties
with Zhcted before the war.</b>

00:09:57.070 --> 00:10:00.700
<b>From what you told me, he's not the kind of man who'd vie for power.</b>

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.700
<b>Well, the thing is...</b>

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:09.210
<b>From what I heard, Duke Thenardier tried to occupy Alsace while Count Vorn was absent.</b>

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.170
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.340
<b>It's been confirmed by several sources.</b>

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.470
<b>What do we do, Roland?</b>

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.840
<b>We proceed as planned.</b>

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:20.470
<b>Should we really?</b>

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.850
<b>There's a Zhctedian army within our borders.</b>

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.770
<b>That's all I need to know.</b>

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:49.670
<b>Titta...</b>

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.590
<b>Oh, right.</b>

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.300
<b>I've been injured.</b>

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.810
<b>How can I fight?</b>

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:11.900
<b>How can I protect them?</b>

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.480
<b>Lord...</b>

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.900
<b>Tigre?</b>

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.790
<b>Young Lord...</b>

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.580
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.290
<b>Sorry about this.</b>

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:39.670
<b>I told you, didn't I? 
I'll always be with you, Lord Tigre.</b>

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.820
<b>Black Bow,</b>

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:49.430
<b>where are you taking me?</b>

