00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:41.100
<b>Leaving their wounded behind in camp, 
the Silver Meteor Stormtroops cross the river overnight.</b>

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.950
<b>Before morning breaks, they take up position facing south.</b>

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:49.080
<b>Opposite them the Order of Navarre assumes a crescent formation.</b>

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.330
<b>Their first squad will chip away at the Silver Meteor's advance guard,</b>

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.750
<b>while the second squad will attack from the flank.</b>

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.710
<b>The third squad will swing around wide, poised to charge</b>

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.210
<b>if the Silver Meteor troops try to pursue the first two squads.</b>

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.550
<b>A multipronged attack based on adaptive teamwork...</b>

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.640
<b>By repeating this pattern, they annihilate the enemy.</b>

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.600
<b>This foolproof strategy was often used by Brune's chivalric orders.</b>

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.600
<b>First squad, charge!</b>

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.080
<b>What's this?</b>

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.370
<b>I think that's Tír na Fa.</b>

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.040
<b>The goddess who presides over night, darkness, and death.</b>

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.050
<b>Darkness and death...</b>

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.180
<b>Are you Tír na Fa?</b>

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.720
<b>Are you the one who called me here?</b>

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.980
<b>I did no such thing.</b>

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:01.480
<b>You came to me because you desire power.</b>

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.860
<b>Or am I wrong?</b>

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.860
<b>That is what you wished for, isn't it?</b>

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.960
<b>While you are idling around here,</b>

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:20.420
<b>your friends and allies are fighting to their deaths.</b>

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.590
<b>I see. You don't want my help.</b>

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.010
<b>Would asking for it make you tell me anything?</b>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.510
<b>So you <i>do</i> want my help.</b>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.310
<b>Fine. I will give you power.</b>

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:41.020
<b>But first you must prove your resolve.</b>

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.270
<b>My resolve?</b>

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.980
<b>Shoot this girl.</b>

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.150
<b>What?</b>

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.610
<b>Let me see how you truly feel.</b>

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:54.160
<b>If your bow acknowledges you, I shall grant you power.</b>

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.370
<b>And what happens to Titta if I don't shoot her?</b>

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.670
<b>Will you leave her alone?</b>

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.960
<b>A very good question.</b>

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.420
<b>She's precious to you, isn't she?</b>

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:10.550
<b>Very well. I'll show you how I feel!</b>

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:27.990
<b>I can more or less tell what you're about to do.</b>

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:32.160
<b>However, are you sure you want to go through with it?</b>

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:37.410
<b>If you put in a little too much power, she'll be blown to pieces.</b>

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.700
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.620
<b>Keep quiet!</b>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.750
<b>More... More...</b>

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.260
<b>Titta, I'm going to shoot you.</b>

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.510
<b>But I promise you won't die!</b>

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:07.870
<b>You applied the power to the arrow so it'd disperse before the girl was hit.</b>

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.900
<b>You may still be lacking through and through,</b>

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:13.660
<b>but the strength of your feelings barely makes the cut.</b>

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:21.210
<b>I was... I was...</b>

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.660
<b>You're all right now.</b>

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.290
<b>You're all right.</b>

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:40.750
<b>I look forward to the day you take full possession of the power I've granted you.</b>

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.440
<b>Take it...</b>

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.610
<b>Shoot them!</b>

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:58.660
<b>The Silver Meteor Stormtroops used sandbags to change the path of the swollen river.</b>

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.250
<b>It flowed onto the plain where the battle is taking place.</b>

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.540
<b>The water will turn the battlefield into a muddy swamp.</b>

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.880
<b>Once we've drawn them in, we'll hit them.</b>

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.130
<b>Looks like this was somewhat of a success.</b>

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.260
<b><i>Trying to pull me away from the main force, are you?</i></b>

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.640
<b><i>I'm game.</i></b>

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.030
<b>Verni!</b>

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.360
<b>More sorcery?!</b>

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:41.240
<b>But your techniques won't work against me and my Durandal!</b>

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:45.460
<b>Shining droplets, fly ahead of me!</b>

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.120
<b>Mutirascu!</b>

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.000
<b>Tear asunder the air!</b>

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.010
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:05.850
<b>Did you kill him?</b>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.140
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:10.150
<b>I'm a knight!</b>

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.360
<b>He cut it apart!</b>

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.490
<b>Your power is something to be feared.</b>

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.410
<b>Actually, I'm even more impressed by your resolve.</b>

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.410
<b>However, you can't best me!</b>

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.810
<b>He shot at me from that distance?</b>

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.070
<b>Tigre...</b>

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.450
<b>War maidens, give me a moment.</b>

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.790
<b>Count Vorn,</b>

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:10.250
<b>rumor has it you invited the Zhctedian army</b>

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.500
<b>into our kingdom to defend Alsace.</b>

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.340
<b>Is that true?</b>

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.250
<b>It is.</b>

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:21.510
<b>They were hired by me so peace can be returned to Alsace.</b>

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.640
<b>We are after Duke Thenardier.</b>

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.560
<b>Once we have defeated him, punished him for his crimes,</b>

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.020
<b>and got paid, we'll return to our own kingdom.</b>

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:35.580
<b>Why don't you help us achieve our goal?</b>

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.740
<b>I cannot accept that offer.</b>

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.030
<b>We are His Royal Majesty's knights.</b>

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.030
<b>I cannot allow insurgents such as yourself to run free!</b>

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.040
<b>I'll fight you with all I've got.</b>

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.160
<b>Roland is using both hands?</b>

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:51.960
<b>Tigre...</b>

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.540
<b>Tigre, are you...!?</b>

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.840
<b>This is bad. My wound is...</b>

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.820
<b>Don't you try to die on me.</b>

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.260
<b>You're mine.</b>

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:09.930
<b>I'm going to win!</b>

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.180
<b>Bring it on!</b>

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.560
<b>To protect my people!</b>

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:23.240
<b>I am Roland, the knight wielding His Majesty's treasured sword!</b>

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:29.910
<b><i>Which of us is giving his life to protect the people?</i></b>

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.370
<b><i>Tigrevurmud Vorn is a traitor.</i></b>

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.290
<b><i>But who has turned him into one?</i></b>

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.550
<b><i>His Majesty bestowed this sword upon me.</i></b>

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.470
<b><i>I received it to protect the people.</i></b>

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.800
<b>To protect!</b>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.620
<b>He stood up.</b>

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.830
<b>He took that shot head-on, yet he's still standing!</b>

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.760
<b>I'm beaten.</b>

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.600
<b>I can't... raise my arms...</b>

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:33.180
<b><i>I was plagued by doubts from start to finish.</i></b>

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.480
<b><i>I cannot win as I now am.</i></b>

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:39.190
<b>I surrender.</b>

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.360
<b>Tigre!</b>

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:50.160
<b>The Order of Navarre withdrew upon Roland's surrender.</b>

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:54.120
<b>He had lost nearly half of his soldiers in the fight.</b>

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:02.630
<b>The Silver Meteor Stormtroops will now finally march on Thenardier to settle matters.</b>

